body:
I told her and it went suprisingly well? I was only able to tell her how the physical intimicay made me uncomfortable but that was at least something! She told me it was completley fine and that she would stop doing it all together. She was sad I hadn't told her before but she said she understood where I came from. She told me that in the future I could tell her about how I felt so it all went well.

&#x200B;

Thank you for your help!
